# ⚙️ Instalação

## 1. Clone o projeto

```bash
git clone https://github.com/seuusuario/inndogz.git
```

---

## 2. Entre na pasta

```bash
cd inndogz
```

---

## 3. Instale as dependências

```bash
npm install
```

---

## 4. Configure o arquivo `.env`

```env
PORT=3000

RESEND_API_KEY=sua_chave_resend

EMAIL_FROM=InnDogz <noreply@seudominio.com>
```

---

## 5. Inicie o servidor

```bash
node server.js
```

---

